// Title: Suspicious Outbound SMTP Connections
// Rule ID: 9976fa64-2804-423c-8a5b-646ade840773
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.t1048.003
// Category: network_connection
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
